OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed as eight crews tackle
OL,4,Aflat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight fire crews are at the scene of a
OL,7,Fflat fire in Derby.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service was
OL,10,Fcalled to reports of the fire in
OL,11,FOsmaston Road, Normanton, shortly after
OL,12,F13:40 BST on Thursday.
OL,14,FThe service said eight crews from
OL,15,FDerbyshire and Nottinghamshire, along
OL,16,Fwith an aerial ladder platform, were at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,19,FDerbyshire Police said the road was
OL,20,Fclosed between Bradshaw Way and
OL,21,FLitchurch Street. Hartington Street is
OL,22,Falso closed.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
